WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.180
Tomorrow is my sixth birthday.

2
00:00:12.181 --> 00:00:20.055
I want a big birthday party.

3
00:00:20.056 --> 00:00:26.595
I want a birthday party at the roller rink. "Whee!"

4
00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:33.435
I want a birthday party with lots of balloons.

5
00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:38.133
"Pop! Pop! Pop!"

6
00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:43.183
I want a birthday party with lots of presents.

7
00:00:43.184 --> 00:00:48.415
"Wow, thanks!"

8
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:54.421
I want a birthday party with lots of games.

9
00:00:54.422 --> 00:00:57.336
"I win!"

10
00:00:57.337 --> 00:01:03.491
I want a birthday party with lots of pizza.

11
00:01:03.492 --> 00:01:07.437
"I love pizza!"

12
00:01:07.438 --> 00:01:14.940
I want a birthday party with lots of ice cream.

13
00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:18.064
"Yummy!"

14
00:01:18.065 --> 00:01:21.296
I can't wait until tomorrow!

15
00:01:21.297 --> 00:01:28.117
It will be lots of fun!
